<title>USA: Room changes symbol on Boston exchange.</title>
<headline>Room changes symbol on Boston exchange.</headline>
<dateline>PATERSON, N.J. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Room Plus Inc said on Monday it changed its symbol on the Boston Stock Exchange to RPF.B from RPI.B.</p>
<p>The company will maintain its Nasdaq symbol as PLUS.B.</p>
<p>Room Plus deals in the design and production and retailing of modular, high pressure, mica-laminated furniture for residential uses.</p>
